# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# Every other address gets 404.html, with status 404.
# 302 rather than 301: browsers keep a 301 indefinitely, and the current docs
# may move to this host later.
/ https://amplicon-docs.qiime2.org/ 302
/en/* https://amplicon-docs.qiime2.org/en/:splat 302

# Data files that current docs download, sent to their copies in the old-docs
# Zenodo record (10.5281/zenodo.24082639), so those docs need no change: the
# Moving Pictures tutorial fetches the first two while it builds (and rebuilds of
# its old versions do too), and amplicon-docs' page on archives in its 2026.10
# release has readers `curl -L` the third. These work once the record is
# published; check that its record id is 24082639.
/2024.10/data/tutorials/feature-classifier/85_otus.qza https://zenodo.org/api/records/24082639/files/85_otus.qza/content 302
/2024.10/data/tutorials/feature-classifier/ref-taxonomy.qza https://zenodo.org/api/records/24082639/files/ref-taxonomy.qza/content 302
/2020.11/data/tutorials/moving-pictures/rep-seqs.qza https://zenodo.org/api/records/24082639/files/rep-seqs.qza/content 302
